# Movia 0.9.32 configuration map (no private values)

Android build:
  MOVIA_CONTROL_PLANE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8888

Backend/private metadata:
  TMDB_API_KEY=<private>

Local P2P:
  MOVIA_TORRSERVER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:18090
  aria2 RPC: 127.0.0.1:6800, configured from agent/runtime/aria2.conf.example

Cloud policy:
  MOVIA_CLOUD_MODE=1 forces direct-only behavior and P2P off.

MCP:
  TERMUX_MCP_HOST / TERMUX_MCP_PORT / TERMUX_MCP_SECRET / TERMUX_MCP_ROOTS / TERMUX_MCP_JOB_ROOT

See SECRETS_SETUP.md for private-value handling and docs/RECOVERY_BLUEPRINT_0.9.32.md for the full runtime graph.
